{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04750","headline":"奉和圣制千秋节宴应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制千秋节宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五德生王者，千龄啓圣人。\n赤光来照夜，黄云上覆晨。\n海县衔恩久，朝章献舞新。\n高居帝座出，夹道衆官陈。\n槊杖洗清景，磬管凝秋旻。\n珠囊含瑞露，金镜抱仙轮。\n何岁无乡饮，何田不报神。\n薰歌与名节，传代幸羣臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}